        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>会被无缘无故讨厌的原因有哪些</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background-color: #e8e6e1;\n    background-image:\n      linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.3), rgba(255,255,255,0.3)),\n      repeating-linear-gradient(0deg, rgba(0,0,0,0.02) 0px, rgba(0,0,0,0.02) 1px, transparent 1px, transparent 3px);\n    font-family: \"SimHei\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", sans-serif;\n  }\n\n  .page {\n    max-width: 700px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 40px 30px 60px 30px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n\n  h1 {\n    color: #2f6b2f;\n    font-size: 22px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    text-align: left;\n    margin: 0 0 30px 0;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n\n  .body-text {\n    color: #333333;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    line-height: 2.1;\n    text-align: justify;\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n\n  .highlight {\n    color: #2f9e44;\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"page\">\n    <h1>1、会被无缘无故讨厌的原因有哪些?</h1>\n    <p class=\"body-text\">\n      \"无缘无故的讨厌\"有很多原因，比如:<br>\n      ①长相凶狠的人让我们害怕(承认吧，我们都是外貌协会);<br>\n      ②刻板印象让你对一个人产生先入为主的偏见:印象里重庆人火爆，上海人爱计较。于是你真去到重庆，并且正好遇到重庆人当街斗殴，你的大脑就会激活\"重庆人火爆\"的认知并加强;<br>\n      <span class=\"highlight\">③心理学上认为的:对一个人的好恶可能是\"投射效应\"在起作用。</span><br>\n      那么，\"投射效应\"到底是如何会让别人无缘无故讨厌你的呢?\n    </p>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>"
